{
  "name": "Webhook Dedupe · 0 Setup (Postgres)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Webhook Dedupe · Setup (Postgres)\nRun this once: open it and press **Execute workflow**. It creates the table `webhook_claims` for the Postgres receiver and `dedupe_lab_claims` for the lab, in the database of the **Webhook Dedupe Postgres** credential. Running it again changes nothing.\n\nThe primary key on `event_key` is the whole point: it is what makes the claim atomic.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "272db58a-813b-437d-89c8-2357be92050c",
      "name": "About",
